// =====================================================================
// EDITABLE SITE DATA — everything an admin changes (via the lock icon,
// bottom-left) is saved here, in the browser's localStorage, and merged
// on top of the CONFIG defaults above. Since this site has no backend,
// this storage is per-browser/per-device only — edits made on your
// laptop won't show up for a visitor on their phone. If you want edits
// to be visible to every visitor, you'd need a small backend or a
// service like Supabase/Firebase to store this centrally instead.
